   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SKL-Support to systems for local self government  in a post-conflict situation - pre-study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A pre-study to prepare a future intervention regarding decentralization and strengthening of the local self-government i Colombia in order to meet the challenges of a possible post-conflict situation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen utg&#xf6;r en f&#xf6;rstudie f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rbereda en insats avseende st&#xf6;d till system f&#xf6;r decentralisering och st&#xe4;rkande av det kommunala sj&#xe4;lvstyret i Colombia i syfte att m&#xf6;ta utmaningarna i en eventuell konfliktsituation.</narrative>
